01:30:56,360 --> 01:30:59,400
 and this is not too far Mutual Info Score,

1822
01:30:59,400 --> 01:31:01,160
 which is therefore harder to judge.

1823
01:31:02,200 --> 01:31:05,640
 This means that we want this score to be

